.It Sy Ctrl+C / Ctrl+X / Ctrl+V
Copy / cut / paste
.It Sy Ctrl+Z / Ctrl+R
Undo / redo
.It Sy Ctrl+Y
Delete line
.It Sy Alt+Up / Alt+Down
Move line up / down
.It Sy Enter / Backspace / Delete
Standard editing
.El
.Ss Files and Tabs
.Bl -tag -width "Ctrl+O"
.It Sy Ctrl+S
