.El
.Ss Splits and Panels
.Bl -tag -width "Ctrl+Alt+P"
.It Sy Ctrl+\e / F6
Split vertical
.It Sy Ctrl+Alt+H / F7
Split horizontal
.It Sy Ctrl+Alt+P / F8
Focus other pane
.It Sy Ctrl+Alt+W
Close pane
.It Sy Ctrl+B / F9
Toggle project tree
.It Sy Ctrl+G
Git panel
.It Sy Alt+T
Toggle terminal
.El
.Ss AI
.Bl -tag -width "Alt+I"
.It Sy Alt+A
